        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:65fbbfcd-f75b-5d72-a620-862cc105bfca",
          "@type": "uco-observable:ExtractedStringsFacet",
          "uco-observable:strings": [
            {
              "@id": "urn:uuid:00132ae6-a6ae-5a38-86b0-ea9599a29331",
              "@type": "uco-observable:ExtractedString",
              "uco-observable:stringValue": "Case 1:23-cr-00064-CJN Document 42 Filed 11/21/24 Page 1 of 4\n\nUNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT\nFOR THE DISTRICT OF COLUMBIA\n\nUNITED STATES OF AMERICA, : CRIMINAL NO. 23-CR-64 (CJN)\n:\nv. :\n:\nJASON REHMAN, :\nDefendant. :\n\nSTATEMENT OF OFFENSE\n\nThe parties in this case, the United States of America and the defendant, Jason Rehman,\n\nstipulate and agree that the following facts are true and accurate. These facts do not constitute all\n\nof the facts known to the parties concerning the charged offense; they are being submitted to\n\ndemonstrate that sufficient facts exist that the defendant committed the offense to which he is\n\npleading guilty: Coercion and Enticement, in violation of 18 U.S.C. \u00a7 2422(b).\n\nStatement of Facts\n\nOn October 13, 2018, the defendant began communicating with the 15-year-old victim\n\n(MV1) on Snapchat. The defendant asked MV1 her age, and she told him that she was fifteen years\n\nold. The defendant told MV1 that he was thirty years old, although he was, in fact, thirty-three\n\nyears old. The defendant requested images of MV1\u2019s feet and directed her on how to pose for him,\n\ntelling her that she was \u201camazing\u201d and \u201cperfect.\u201d Shortly thereafter, he requested that MV1 send\n\nhim a photo of her vagina. After MV1 sent him a photo depicting her vagina, the defendant told\n\nher, \u201cI love the hair on it\u201d and asked her to take and send him a second photo of her vagina from\n\nfurther away. After she sent a second photo depicting her vagina, the defendant responded, \u201cIt\u2019s\n\nso hairy I love that!!!!\u201d\n\nBetween October 13, 2018, and November 7, 2018, the defendant continued to engage in\n\nsexually explicit conversations with MV1 over Snapchat, including at times while he was in the\n\n1\nCase 1:23-cr-00064-CJN Document 42 Filed 11/21/24 Page 2 of 4\n\nDistrict of Columbia. During these conversations, the defendant repeatedly persuaded, attempted\n\nto induce, and encouraged MV1 to send him photos of her vagina. He instructed her on how to\n\ntake the photos, directing her, for example, to \u201cspread your pussy\u201d and to \u201cspread your ass cheeks.\u201d\n\nHe repeatedly flattered her in an effort to entice her to continue sending photos, telling her how\n\nmuch he loved her \u201cpussy,\u201d that she had a \u201cperfect body,\u201d and that he \u201ccouldn\u2019t believe how\n\nbeautiful and sweet you are.\u201d The defendant also repeatedly discussed how much he wanted to\n\nhave sex with MV1, stating, for example, that he had \u201cnever fucked a young girl\u201d and that she was\n\n\u201cmaking [his] dreams come true.\u201d He also asked MV1 if he could have sex with her without a\n\ncondom, writing, \u201c[c]an I please put him inside you no condom just in and out that\u2019s all\u201d and \u201cI\n\nwant to feel it so bad.\u201d The defendant continued making plans to have sex with MV1, despite MV1\n\ntelling him that she was depressed, bullied, and had previously tried to kill herself.\n\nAfter messaging MV1 for approximately two weeks, the defendant arranged to meet MV1\n\nat a park outside her home in Virginia to have sex. On the night of October 25, 2018, MV1 agreed\n\nto sneak out of her home after her parents fell asleep and meet the defendant in the park. The\n\ndefendant traveled to the park in Virginia from his workplace in Washington, D.C. and picked\n\nMV1 up in his car. Inside the defendant\u2019s car, the defendant penetrated both MV1\u2019s vagina and\n\nmouth with his penis. On November 7, 2018, the defendant again traveled across state lines to the\n\npark in Virginia to have sex with MV1, this time leaving from his home in Maryland. The\n\ndefendant again picked MV1 up in his car and penetrated her vagina and mouth with his penis\n\nwhile they were inside his vehicle.\n\nOn February 9, 2019, while criminal charges were pending against the defendant in Fairfax\n\nCounty, Virginia, for the above-mentioned conduct, the defendant contacted MV1 and directed\n\nher to call his then-attorney and falsely claim that she had told him she was eighteen years old.\n\n2\nCase 1:23-cr-00064-CJN Document 42 Filed 11/21/24 Page 3 of 4\n\nIn addition to MV1, the defendant requested photos and engaged in sexually explicit\n\nconversations with other minors over Snapchat, including two of MV1\u2019s classmates.\n\nRespectfully,\n\nMATHEW GRAVES\nUNITED STATES ATTORNEY\n\n_/s/ Caroline Burrell______________\nCaroline Burrell\nAssistant United States Attorney\nAngelica Carrasco\nTrial Attorney\n\n3\nCase 1:23-cr-00064-CJN Document 42 Filed 11/21/24 Page 4 of 4\n\n7/9/2024"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
